Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:03.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Energy gets wasted for a boring reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:06.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,nobody trusts the forecast enough to act on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:10.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Last year I built Agentic Arbiter, on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.19,0:00:12.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's live, and this is it running.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:14.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,Data centres run chillers even when
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.95,0:00:17.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,the air outside is already cold enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:20.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pick a real site, and the plant's own limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.69,0:00:22.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then I let the agent decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:26.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,It works hour by hour, deciding when it's safe to shut the chillers off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:30.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,It made no unsafe calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.37,0:00:33.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,The old controller made one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.70,0:00:37.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Over five real years, that's about four hundred extra hours a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:39.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,And it grades itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.69,0:00:42.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Here it's missing its own target, and saying so.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:44.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,That's the part I'm proudest of.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:46.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Second of eight hundred and forty-two teams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.12,0:00:48.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,The UN's Cool Coalition picked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:51.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pakistan has solar on millions of roofs,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:53.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,but the grid can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.86,0:00:57.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Go over two hundred units a month, and every unit gets re-priced.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:00.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,So I'm building a Solar Home Agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.53,0:01:04.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,It reads tomorrow's weather, then picks when to run the motor and the iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.20,0:01:09.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Same habit: it remembers how wrong it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:13.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Moving a few jobs into the afternoon keeps this home under the limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.46,0:01:14.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,About five thousand rupees this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:17.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nearly nineteen thousand over the next six.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.22,0:01:19.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's a simulation, on one real month of Islamabad weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.20,0:01:24.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,When it isn't sure, it says no,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:26.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,and tells you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.70,0:01:30.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,It keeps score against what the sun actually did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.50,0:01:34.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,But look what it can't fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.50,0:01:37.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,It still wastes most of its midday sun, and buys after dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.33,0:01:38.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Storage closes that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.30,0:01:40.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next: five to ten homes in Islamabad, over WhatsApp.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.01,0:01:44.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,I'm starting an Energy-and-AI circle at COMSATS, and I'd join IRENA NewGen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:48.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then add those homes into one neighbourhood forecast, with our distribution company.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.30,0:01:50.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,The solar is already on Pakistan's roofs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:54.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want to help the grid see it, and trust it.
